<div class="py-6">
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8">
    <div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">My Assignments</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-600">Assignments you've posted for team formation.</p>
    </div>
    <%= link_to "+ New Assignment", new_assignment_path, class: "rounded-lg bg-blue-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors" %>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">

    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-200 border-l-4 border-l-blue-600 p-5 flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Database Normalization Project</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 line-clamp-3">Design and implement a fully normalized relational database schema for a university library system. Include ER diagrams and SQL scripts.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-gray-100">
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">Posted 2 days ago</span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-green-100 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-green-700">Active</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-200 border-l-4 border-l-blue-600 p-5 flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">REST API Design</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 line-clamp-3">Design and document a RESTful API for an e-commerce platform. Include authentication, pagination, and error handling patterns.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-gray-100">
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">Posted 5 days ago</span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-green-100 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-green-700">Active</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-200 border-l-4 border-l-gray-400 p-5 flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Operating Systems Homework</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 line-clamp-3">Implement a simple round-robin process scheduler in C. Simulate context switching and calculate average turnaround time.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-gray-100">
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">Posted 14 days ago</span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-gray-100 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-gray-600">Closed</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
